WEBVTT

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.580
W-what did you say?!

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.290
Your boyfriend is coming to the house today?!

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:11.380
I'm sorry I failed to tell you that, Father.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:15.080
This is the first time my daughter
has brought a boyfriend home...

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:20.880
Of course, to a father, something like that
makes the heart ache.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.040
Wrong, Father,

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
the place where it aches the first time is...

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.130
That isn't what I mean!

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.540
But what time is he coming here?

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.290
In about forty minutes.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.500
I'm nervous...

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:39.830
Why don't you take a walk
to get your mind off of this?

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.250
I-I see...

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:43.290
What will I do about lunch?

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.380
I'll go buy something.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.330
Will you? Then please do.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:49.830
I'll also prepare to entertain our guest.

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:51.880
I'll be back.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:58.920
It's just like Fuyumi to be calm
even at a time like this.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.960
Is there anything I can help you with?

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:03.540
If you would like to...

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.330
Please check the stickiness of this.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.960
What type of entertainment are you planning?

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:49.750
She's already reached the age
where she's bringing home boys, huh?

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:55.040
I wonder if I'm here much too early?

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.170
Yes?

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:02.380
Kosaka-san... Has something about you changed?

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:05.830
Are you... Akiho's boyfriend?

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:06.830
Huh?

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.250
Oh! You're her mother?!

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.210
I'm sorry!

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.630
You resemble Kosaka-san so much,
I didn't realize...

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:16.210
Akiho is out picking up supplies right now.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.250
I'll entertain you until she returns.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.080
"Entertain"?

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:24.750
A cup of tea?

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.040
Thank you...

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:29.750
Oh no, that's okay, you don't have to cater to me.

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:31.790
I see...

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.880
This certainly may become adulterous.

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:35.790
Huh?

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:39.130
What kind of 'entertainment'
did she have planned?!

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.420
Here's black tea.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:45.040
Thank you.

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:47.920
Shinozaki-san... How many for you?

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.330
Yes, this year I'll be seventeen...

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.040
Oh, sugar...

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:57.250
I'm sorry! You wouldn't ask my age
while making tea, right?

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.420
I'm sorry as well, there was no subject...

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.920
How many rubbers do you have on you?

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.080
So is this the conversation for making tea?

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:10.250
Family planning is important,
and if you're dating Akiho, then...

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:13.830
By the way, do you have siblings or anything?

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.250
Good, a normal topic.

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:22.330
Y-yes, I have a little sister...
But she's kind of mischievous.

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:25.210
Oh my, isn't being lively a good thing?

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:27.380
She's a bit too lively, though.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.790
We only have Akiho here...

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:32.670
Maybe I should have thought of
giving her a sister?

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:34.630
Th-there's no point in asking me that!

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:38.630
Well then, which position is best
to easily have a girl?

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.630
There's no point in asking me that!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.880
Different subject, different subject...

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:45.790
Excuse me, what's that?

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.960
Oh, this here...

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:53.330
I-is that Akiho's boyfriend?!

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:58.040
Why is he this early?!
It's a bit difficult to go in now...

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:02.040
Is that... Akiho's album?

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:05.000
This is from when Akiho was three.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.420
She liked to read books, huh?

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:10.210
That's right, especially picture books.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:12.130
Wow, that's cute!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.330
This is when she was four.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.500
She still liked reading books, huh?

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:20.960
That's right, especially
things like excite books.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.380
What happened during that year?

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:32.080
Fuyumi has been devoted to education
since Akiho was small.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.630
Akiho is already one, huh?

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:37.790
Children grow so fast.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.170
I'm happy she's growing, but...

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:43.830
I wonder if one day she'll say "I hate Papa"?

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:45.540
Please don't worry.

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:48.750
I've already obtained knowledge
on how to avoid that problem.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.670
Well done, Fuyumi! You're always prepared!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.920
Right! I did research via this DVD!

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.420
That's a different type of 'Papa.'

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:58.750
Papa.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:08.080
Akiho is getting whiney...

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.960
I'll take care of that.

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:13.170
Akiho?

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:15.580
You mustn't cry over something like ripped paper.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:18.130
Oh... As expected of a mother...

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:21.960
When you rip your hymen,
it'll really make you cry even more.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:23.130
Please stop.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.500
Could that position possibly be...

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:43.460
the missionary position?!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.750
What's more, lifting her leg
and guiding the man...

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.540
And going so far as having the consideration
of patting him gently on the head?!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:50.830
Natsuo-san!

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:53.250
Akiho may have a special talent!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:58.960
I'm not sure what talent that would be,
but it seems best not to ask...

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:06.040
Ah, her face is all messy.

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:09.460
Akiho, you have to eat properly.

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:12.580
She's still a year old, we can let it go for now.

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:14.540
At times like this, you look up through your lashes

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:16.880
and say "A whole lot came out."

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.500
What are you teaching a one-year old?

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:23.210
I'm not sure if her gifted education classes
at that time were good or bad...

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:26.460
Huh?

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:28.500
What are you doing over there?

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.250
Gulp!

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:33.790
I'm sorry for having you help me with tidying up...

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:36.880
No, high places are dangerous.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:39.170
Oh my.

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:43.880
I haven't had lunch yet.
I had planned on eating with Akiho-san, but...

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:46.170
I know! You should eat together with us.

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:51.080
Me too? Together? I see.

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:53.920
Shinozaki-san goes for married women, too.

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:57.000
Are you misunderstanding
what I mean by 'eat together'?

00:07:57.130 --> 00:08:00.170
You are an adolescent boy,
so I was thinking, perhaps...

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:01.710
Y-you misunderstand!

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:04.290
I'm back home.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.250
Over there with Dad, now...

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:09.790
Oh, Shinozaki-san, you're here!

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:13.880
Kosaka-san! Thanks for going out to buy things.
That looks heavy...

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:16.630
It is. It's lunch for four people.

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:18.960
Here you go, it's oyakodon.

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:20.290
At a time like this?!

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:22.880
I'm sorry, do you hate it?

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:26.250
Oh, no! It's okay, I really love oyakodon!

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:29.290
So you really do like that parent-child thing!

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:31.040
Let's have a temporary change of subject!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:35.580
So you have a new attribute
aside from being a loli-pedo M!

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.580
But I'm not a loli-pedo M!

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:40.250
I have to change the subject to something else!

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:45.580
A-are you perhaps Kosaka-san's father?

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.250
Y-yes I am.

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.830
Oh, it's nice to meet you, Sir! I'm Haruka Shinozaki.

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:52.670
I hope we can continue to get along in the future!

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:53.790
Uh, yeah...

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:57.960
Why is Shinozaki-san
so passionate towards Natsuo-san...

00:08:58.380 --> 00:08:59.830
Oh! Perhaps...!

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.290
Is THAT the oyakodon you're aiming for?

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:05.170
Oh yeah!

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:06.880
No!

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:12.460
I-I'm tired...

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:14.330
Shinozaki-kun.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:15.960
Sir...

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:18.330
I think you have a hard time with things as well...

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:20.170
You think he's a pervert?

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:21.790
No!
No!

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:25.540
In any case, please...
continue to take care of Akiho.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.630
O-okay!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:29.540
I'll see Shinozaki-san off.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:30.790
Thanks.

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:32.580
Thank you for having me.

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:37.000
I couldn't really entertain him very well.

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:40.130
I'm sorry for my shortcomings...

00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:42.290
No, that isn't true...

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:44.040
Oh, speaking of...

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:44.880
Huh?

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:47.920
You've said the same thing before, too.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:51.250
Yeah, back when Akiho was just born.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.830
I keep having to come home on the last train...

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:57.460
Welcome home.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:00.130
What? You're still awake today again?

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:03.500
As a wife, I mustn't go to sleep before my husband...

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.420
But I told you not to worry about that...

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:09.710
Aren't you sleep-deprived
because of Akiho's crying at night?

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.750
I'm sorry for my shortcomings...

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:17.500
Thanks for always doing your best
for the sake of our family.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.040
Natsuo-san...

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:24.380
You've been a wonderful wife ever since then.

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:32.790
I remember that time. I was very happy...

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:38.040
I'm so lucky for having been given
such a wonderful husband.

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:43.330
I want you to be happy someday, just like this.

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:47.080
I'll teach you the necessary knowledge for that sake.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:50.880
For when you happen across a wonderful person.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:57.080
"Ah, this is my first time having two at once..."

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.330
I'm home...

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:02.130
Huh?

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:04.080
What are you two doing?

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:06.580
Ah, Father. Welcome home.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:09.960
Natsuo-san, I'm sorry
I couldn't come to welcome you home.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:13.580
What were you talking about so eagerly?

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:16.580
Actually, I was giving advice.

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:19.920
Tomorrow, Akiho is going
on her first date with Shinozaki-san.

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:22.000
First date?!

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.170
Yes, we're going to watch a movie.

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:29.460
I-I see, for your first date as well, huh?
I remember mine.

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:33.330
My first date with Fuyumi was also a movie.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.080
Right.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:39.710
But it's a shame that the 'excite movie' theater
that we went to isn't around anymore.

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:41.580
But we didn't go to that one.

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:43.380
In any case, Akiho...

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:44.630
Yes, Mother?

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:49.710
If you want to get closer to him, no matter what it is,
you have to give it all you've got.

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:53.130
If you do that, your sincerity
will be conveyed to your partner.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:56.250
Give it all I've got, right?

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.210
That's right. For example...

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.790
Even if something is bitter and sticks in your throat,

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:02.460
you give it all you've got and swallow it.

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:04.420
Wait. It's a bit too early for that...

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:06.040
You think so?

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:08.710
Well then, maybe try giving all you've got

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:11.250
and researching how to
further develop a relationship.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:12.880
Research...

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.790
Research, huh...

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:17.920
You don't have to deviate from the norm with that...

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:21.000
With this, the man of your dreams
will be crazy for you!

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:24.000
She's cute when she tips her head!

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:27.130
This is it!

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:38.540
Morning, Kosaka-san!

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.880
Good morning, Shinozaki-san.

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:47.710
Kosaka-san looks very cute today!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.330
Don't you notice it?

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.710
Huh?! Well... I was just thinking
that your clothes are really nice.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:56.290
No, not that.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:02.960
From now on I plan on committing to the 30 degrees,
but what do you think?

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:05.080
What do you mean by '30 degrees'?

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:10.040
I'm gonna show you my ultra technique!

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:11.710
Oh no!

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.210
It's seriously impressive!

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:15.630
I don't know where I should look...

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.540
She's really observing them!

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:22.500
Don't tell me... she wants to try it?!

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.330
"I'm gonna show you my ultra technique!"

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:27.250
THAT part?!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:34.170
A romantic movie is perfect for a date...

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:35.710
Let's do it.

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:37.830
Huh?! What?!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.630
Be gentle... with me...

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.500
They're going that far?

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:45.170
This is pretty extreme...

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:52.170
Surprisingly, I got some good research
from that movie.

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:53.330
R-really?

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:55.830
There are so many love techniques...

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:58.250
With that, it seems I'll be able to utilize them soon.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.790
Y-you don't really have to utilize them!

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:02.830
I see...

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:05.170
Then we will never, under
any circumstances use them, huh?

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:08.210
C-crap! My modesty has betrayed me!

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:12.500
Just kidding. It was a joke.

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:13.830
Huh?

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.380
I don't know the boundary
between her serious and her playful side...

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:19.380
Roar.
Shobitch!

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:30.000
Kosaka-san... Thanks for
hanging out with me today, it was a lot of fun.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:33.540
I had fun, too. It was a very fulfilling day.

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.420
I was able to do a lot of research.

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:38.460
What did you enjoy, Shinozaki-san?

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.960
Huh? I...

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:46.130
Just you being here with me today was a lot of fun...

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.250
O-oh no...

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:55.000
I was too obsessed with my research,
and I forgot to do fun things with Shinozaki-san!

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.710
Wh-what's wrong, Kosaka-san?!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:02.580
I wonder if I said something bad...

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.830
What do I do? I want to do
something to make her happy...

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:22.130
I know!

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:24.420
Hey, Kosaka-san!

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:27.750
If possible, do you want to go see
the cherry blossoms next Sunday?

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:29.080
Cherry blossoms?

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:34.080
Yeah! The petals are going to fall soon,
and we haven't done anything spring-like.

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:37.580
So then... Next week we'll be together again?

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:38.960
Yeah!

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:45.630
Let's do it! And we must have
a picnic at the same time!

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:49.380
She's much happier than I imagined... that's great.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:51.750
I'll make a 500 page itinerary,

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:55.500
and we'll have a 500 square meter picnic sheet
and 69 varieties of snacks,

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:59.420
and also at least a barbecue set,
fireworks, a drone, and stamina drinks,

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:01.380
and also bananas and bitter melon...

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.540
Yep, more than I imagined.

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:05.580
I'll show you my ultra technique.

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:10.920
I'm looking forward to this Sunday!

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:14.040
Morning, Kosaka-san! Huh?

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:15.960
Kosaka-san?!

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:20.500
I was so anxious for the cherry blossom party,
I didn't sleep at all at night...

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.710
It doesn't look like just sleep-deprivation...

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:27.920
I want to see cherry blossoms... with... you...

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:33.580
I want to... I wanna... do more...

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:35.710
I want to...

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.460
K..Kosaka-san?!

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:39.830
For now, let's head to the nurse's office!

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:40.920
Let's head there!

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:42.960
Excuse me!

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:46.750
Koshimizu-sensei! Can she take a short rest here?

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:48.330
Sure!

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:52.460
However, anything longer than three hours
you'll be charged for!

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.540
We don't need that type of silliness!

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:59.290
C'mon. I can't take money from a student, can I?

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:00.920
So it was a joke...

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:03.790
Payment is with your bo-dy!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.330
That's a joke, right?

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:11.040
Hmm, maybe it's a cold.
If you're worried I should call her parents.

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:15.290
Well, I've got something to do
so I'm counting on you!

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:17.290
Huh? You're leaving?!

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:21.210
I'm not leaving. I haven't even COME yet!

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:24.250
Why are there so many people
like this at my school?

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:28.170
My mother says she'll come and get me.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:34.210
So you're leaving early today, then.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.000
39 degrees?!

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:41.040
I'm sorry... I'll definitely be better
before the cherry blossom viewing.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:42.960
Kosaka-san...

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:45.960
For the time being,
you should have some fluids.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.880
Thank you.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.630
K..Kosaka-san?!

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:56.170
The fluid is sinking into me...

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:58.380
It's sinking into you from a different spot, though!

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:00.040
A towel, a towel!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:03.290
Have I possibly wet myself?!

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:05.790
I-it's okay! That's tea!

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:08.420
I'll help you drink it, so stay still.

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:12.540
Is this your... 'holy water'?

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.630
Can you tell the difference between that and tea?

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:20.290
If you desire watersports...
It will be my first time, but I'll do my best.

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:21.380
This is no good...

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:24.500
For Kosaka-san's sake,
I have to bring her home soon...

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:29.040
Excuse me. I'm Akiho Kosaka's mother.

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.630
Great! She's here!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.460
You're doing watersports in a place like this?!

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:35.130
It's the Kosaka family gene!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:38.040
Abbreviated, that's KDNA!

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:41.130
No, this is just something that happened
for such and such a reason...
Oh me oh my...

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:45.960
Sh..Shinozaki-san... There are three of him.

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:48.960
I see... So that's what it was...

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.040
I'm glad that you understand.

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:56.500
Sh..Shinozaki-san... all three of them...
doing watersports...

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:58.540
You did want to do that after all, huh?

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.080
And what's more, oyakodon style!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:00.790
C'mon!

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:01.920
Hurry!

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:04.000
You're wrong!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:13.080
I can't believe things have become like this...

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:15.710
Rest your body for a while.

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:20.380
But... I have to get better by Sunday...

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:22.540
Akiho...

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:42.130
Yes, hello?

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:44.420
Huh, really?!

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:51.540
Kosaka-san!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:55.210
Good morning, Shinozaki-san!

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:57.790
Are you really better already?!

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:59.750
My fever is completely gone!

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:01.750
That's great! Okay then...!

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:03.540
Yeah, let's go!

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:07.630
The cherry blossoms are waiting for us in full bloom!

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:10.920
Whaaaaat?!

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:13.330
The blossoms have fallen?

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:17.250
I see... It's because of the rain
that fell until yesterday...

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:20.420
K..Kosaka-san, I'm sorry.

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:26.000
I-I-I-It's okay, Sh-Shi-Shinozaki-san...
I do-do-don't I do-don't mind at all...

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.580
What a huge lie...

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:31.880
Once I eat lunch or something,
I'll calm... calm ca-ca-ca-ca...

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:33.540
She's shaking hard!

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:39.290
Today for sure, I want to properly enjoy the time
that I'm together with Shinozaki-san...

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:41.710
I-it's okay, Kosaka-san!

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:44.290
Even if the blossoms have fallen,
we can still have a picnic!

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:46.710
Moreover, if you really must see cherry blossoms...

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:48.040
There's next year.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:50.420
Next year, we can come here again!

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:53.630
Next... year...?

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:57.210
Oh, no! I'm not saying
that we should give up on this year...

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:02.630
Next year... still together...

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:07.080
We'll come here again, right?

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:20.630
With just those words, I'm very happy.

00:23:03.170 --> 00:23:08.210
Welcome to the exciho! Is this a rest? Or a stay?

00:23:08.210 --> 00:23:10.960
W-w-what do we do? Um...uh...

00:23:10.960 --> 00:23:12.710
A stay, please.

00:23:12.710 --> 00:23:14.000
S-stay?!

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:19.210
M-maybe Kosaka-san... will take advantage
of this opportunity... and want to-?!

00:23:19.670 --> 00:23:24.330
It seems like the rain will last until morning,
so take your time.

00:23:24.330 --> 00:23:29.250
U-until morning?! I see!
That's why you chose to stay the night, right?

00:23:29.250 --> 00:23:33.420
Huh?! Uh, um... Th-that's right...

00:23:33.670 --> 00:23:36.170
Huh? What is that hesitation?

00:23:36.170 --> 00:23:38.790
It couldn't be... No!
